      "writtenOn": "2025-04-04T15:01:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Dawn doesn\u0027t have public API to verify that. Maybe we can add an API that returns BackendTexture and its Views created from internal `MakeTextureViews` to be safe.\n\ne.g.\n```\nstd::pair\u003cBackendTexture, wgpu::TextureView\u003e MakeDawnAndView(...);\n```",
