      "writtenOn": "2025-04-04T14:25:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we not have a case wehre there\u0027s a renderView but not a sampleView? We wouldn\u0027t necessarily want to replace the render texture view that was provided. Although it looks like in the impl of `MakeTextureViews`, we always create the sample view even if it\u0027s on a texture that isn\u0027t sampleable.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 190,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 190,
        "endChar": 68
      },
      "revId": "0b5f60f2da1d3c8619aae477ece59057c5d3e53b",
